    {
      "id": "claim_9c8581795c85485cbb3f7c3b0a6f07ff",
      "statement": "`ComparisonPageBuilder` is a library-only reporting tool, not a console entry: it assembles a self-contained HTML page with base64 PNG data URIs for the slice grids and the rendered FID/reward curves, and renders a clearly marked pending slot instead of inventing a comparison when no ControlNet eval directory is supplied.",
