          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b36a46cc010177414379aeee09d2f80cf856680eba2f204c2b6793ba56647574:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_570547a1479842c5970e83c348c87ce5",
      "statement": "The monitor keeps the measurement stable and reproducible: it selects a seeded `randperm` prefix of the paired validation set and caches the collated subset, re-seeds the generation noise on every gated epoch, and resets the two module-attached `torchmetrics.MeanMetric` instances before each update so the logged value is the current epoch's value rather than a running mean.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py#L133-L146",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a6d316deb38cf5124af2ea1ea95b162736a217e89ee40a8c5e7f079f7d12cfc4:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py#L150-L217",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d3cab92699d84c40d0c1a7bc5c4e604520f3fe39e4f896aa77b529666c36e463:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py#L47-L51",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:14ac5d0fc53ffd6bbddd7bc9c3ea873538fea3d8148f03d8f0a5e75d5a86c786:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_715e912398af424c973cbb1902f0fb21",
      "statement": "`PairedFidelitySpec` is the registry spec for the monitor: its knobs are `subset_size`, `every_n_epochs`, `num_inference_steps` and `seed`, its `logged_metrics` is a ClassVar rather than a knob, and `build` takes the rollout step count from `CallbackContext.inference_recipe` when the per-callback knob is unset (falling back to 15).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/callbacks/paired_fidelity.py#L36-L75",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2c220edce50b7369395e72c29eca98fc1baeff8a1c5ed61188da0f3ef97a12a3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2a2701ba6b3b433292a333c7e078c59e",
      "statement": "The supervised ControlNet shell enables the monitor by default: it registers the `paired_fidelity` spec on the spine's registry, lists it in the default callback names, and fills the previously-empty `CallbackContext.inference_recipe` with the existing `controlnet.num_inference_steps` knob so the rollout depth stays recipe-primary.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/controlnet_cli.py#L168-L198",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5446a4872d3a7c262ac18f17012b78d5d9325c828070feb27d14d31fdce070bd:"
