    },
    {
      "id": "claim_891832777ed94877a863104f91fe54c9",
      "statement": "The monitor is observe-only: it declares `val/psnr` and `val/ssim` only as validatable monitor candidates, the supervised checkpoint monitor stays `val/x0_mae`, and the callback never enters the loss, the optimizer, the EMA, or checkpoint selection.",
