    {
      "id": "claim_e7dbb4e799a3412abcbc0b96e6d4cef2",
      "statement": "Under DDP the monitor is a redundant evaluation: every rank scores the same fixed subset under the same seeded noise on DDP-synchronized weights, so the only cross-rank interaction is Lightning's torchmetrics sync, and the 2-rank gate asserts identical logged and rank-local values with the checkpoint monitor still `val/x0_mae`.",
