    {
      "id": "claim_4ea5bc506a9f4b12b626b1e41d8a499f",
      "statement": "The paired validation dataset is resolved lazily at the first gated epoch via `getattr(datamodule, \"val_latent_ds\", datamodule)`, so the cold path's post-`setup()` replacement of the warmed validation dataset is honored and the build step never binds the dataset.",
