    {
      "id": "claim_07049291ede546ffbcad65f27c7dd6d8",
      "statement": "Extending the monitor to the ControlNet-GRPO stage is not implemented: the GRPO shell registers only train_loss/fid/checkpoint and, for a ControlNet policy, forbids FID both at default-derivation and post-merge through `forbidden_callbacks={\"fid\": ...}` and `forbidden_monitors={\"val/fid\": ...}`, so releasing that blanket ban for this callback specifically remains an open follow-up.",
